OL,4,BNicholls sets record for jump winners  
OL,5,Bby British trainer                     
OL,6,GPaul Nicholls has surpassed Martin     
OL,7,GPipe to set a new National Hunt record 
OL,8,Gfor winners by a British trainer.      
OL,10,FThe 14-time champion claimed his       
OL,11,F3,931st win at Warwick on Thursday as  
OL,12,FKnappers Hill secured victory in the   
OL,13,FDenis O'Connell Memorial Veterans'     
OL,14,FHandicap Chase.                        
OL,16,FSince starting as a trainer in 1991,   
OL,17,FNicholls has gone on to look after     
OL,18,Fsome legendary horses such as Kauto    
OL,19,FStar, Big Buck's and Denman.           
